OL,3,GNEWSASex offender jailed for
OL,4,A'calculated' abuse of girl
OL,5,
OL,6,FA sex offender has been jailed for the
OL,7,F"calculated" and "sustained" abuse of a
OL,8,Fvulnerable young girl over a number of
OL,9,Fyears.
OL,11,FJames Groves, 51, of Little Stoke,
OL,12,FSouth Gloucestershire, was sentenced to
OL,13,F20 years and six months for 19 separate
OL,14,Fsexual offences at Bristol Crown Court
OL,15,Fon Friday.
OL,17,FGroves, who also goes by the name of
OL,18,FApril, was found guilty by a jury of
OL,19,Fthe non-recent offences, including nine
OL,20,Fcounts of rape, at the same court on 5
OL,21,FJune.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
