OL,3,GNEWSASex offender jailed for
OL,4,A'calculated' abuse of girl
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe victim, who was commended by police
OL,7,Ffor her "exceptional bravery", told the
OL,8,Fcourt: "I have lost my childhood
OL,9,Fbecause of what they did, and I will
OL,10,Fnever get it back."
